        "7534": {"comment":"Again"},
        "7536": {"synopsis":"PLAY's errors: the AY chips silenced and interrupts on first, then the error code through\nNextZXOS ROM 1's ERROR_128_A: $29, report n Out of range.","comment":"The AY silenced"},
        "7585": {"synopsis":"Starts every string's note that has not ended: its name read (PLAY_NOTE_NAME); not a rest:\nsounded (PLAY_SOUND) and its volume set.","comment":"The list from its start; string 0's bit"},
