        "7689": {"comment":"IY + 38 = the shortest length"},
        "7696": {"synopsis":"After the wait: each string's current length less the time waited; one at 0 ends its note\n(volume 0) and goes on to its next tied length or, with none left, its next note\n(PLAY_NEXT), which is started (PLAY_SOUND) and marked in a word on the stack; then a short\nwait, and the new notes' volumes (PLAY_ADV_VOLUMES).","comment":"BC = 0: no new notes yet"},
        "7700": {"comment":"The list from its start; string 0's bit"},
